item.casual_tinkering.circular_saw.name=Circular Saw
item.casual_tinkering.circular_saw.desc=A heavy woodcutting tool with a spinning blade. Charges up to unleash a wide sweeping attack.\nRight Click: Charge and unleash area attack
item.casualtinkering.magicdevice.name=Magic Device
item.casualtinkering.magicdevice.desc=Magic Device is a mid-range weapon that summons magical swords for coordinated attacks, and can be equipped in the chestplate slot.\nRight-click: Charge to summon magical swords for mid-range strikes.\nOff-hand/Chestplate: When attacking with a sword in main hand, summons magical swords to assist.\nFull cooldown attack: Summons a magical sword on hit.
modifier.auto_device.name=Auto Device
modifier.auto_device.desc=§oSet and forget!§r\nAutomatically strikes nearby hostile mobs when in main hand.
modifier.precision_sawing.name=Precision Sawing
modifier.precision_sawing.desc=§oFine sawing!§r\nLogs that can be processed into planks drop as planks instead.
modifier.overclock.name=Overclock
modifier.overclock.desc=§oMay cause lag!§r\nIncreases damage dealt to secondary targets during sweeping attacks.
modifier.magic_lance.name=Magic Lance
modifier.magic_lance.desc=§oWhoosh—Thud!§r\nCharged right-click summons a falling lance that deals area damage.